rk together to save their crumbling family legacy and their marriage?</p>","updated":1795124106,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/91202"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3822798","name":"Episode 6"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3822799","name":"Episode 7"}}}}},{"id":3822801,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3822801/taming-the-husband-1x08-episode-8","name":"Episode 8","season":1,"number":8,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-11-20","airtime":"12:00","airstamp":"2026-11-20T04:00:00+00:00","runtime":35,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3822801"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/91202","name":"Taming the Husband"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":91202,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/91202/taming-the-husband","name":"Taming the Husband","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Romance"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":35,"premiered":"2026-11-18","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://www.mgtv.com/h/860383/24280968.html","schedule":{"time":"12:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":59,"network":{"id":276,"name":"Hunan TV","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"webChannel":{"id":226,"name":"Mango TV","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":"https://w.mgtv.com/"},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/651/1629747.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/651/1629747.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Jin Bao Zhu, the spirited daughter of a butcher, has always harbored simple, materialistic dreams of wealth and comfort. Desperate to escape her oppressive family life, she volunteers t